    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "スペシャルウィーク",
            "enName": "Special Week",
            "jpText": "はぁ～……いつ乗っても、\r\nマルゼンさんのドライブはドキドキです……。\nブライトさんは、乗ったことありますか？",
            "enText": "Phew… No matter how many times I ride with\nMaruzen, her driving always makes me tense\nup… Bright, have you ever been in her car?",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": -4140619191570900309,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロブライト",
            "enName": "Mejiro Bright",
            "jpText": "ええ、つい先日お誘いをいただきまして～。",
            "enText": "I have. She was kind enough to invite me\nfor a drive just the other day.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": 1516426948468621454,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "スペシャルウィーク",
            "enName": "Special Week",
            "jpText": "じゃ、じゃあ……！\r\nブライトさんもあの振り落とされそうな\nスピードを体験したんですね……！",
            "enText": "Ohhh! So you know what it's like, then — the\nsheer speed that makes you feel like you're\ngoing to be thrown out the window!",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": -6139157843359770629,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロブライト",
            "enName": "Mejiro Bright",
            "jpText": "スピード……。",
            "enText": "Speed?",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": 3408962679680548592,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "スペシャルウィーク",
            "enName": "Special Week",
            "jpText": "目玉が置いていかれそうな急発進！\r\nシュバババーッと通りすぎていく景色！",
            "enText": "Those sudden accelerations that almost pop\nyour eyes out! The scenery <i>whooshing</i> by in\nan instant!",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": -8834182928321888490,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロブライト",
            "enName": "Mejiro Bright",
            "jpText": "ええっと～。",
            "enText": "Well…",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": 8972133407753783897,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "スペシャルウィーク",
            "enName": "Special Week",
            "jpText": "思い出しても脚がガクガクですけど……\r\nもしかしたら、マルゼンさんの走りの秘訣は\nあのドライブテクにあるのかもって思って！",
            "enText": "Just thinking about it makes my legs all\nwobbly… You know what — maybe her driving\nskills are the secret to her incredible running!",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": 3184569480203504146,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "スペシャルウィーク",
            "enName": "Special Week",
            "jpText": "どう思いますか、ブライトさんっ！？",
            "enText": "What do you think, Bright?!",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": 7386100854334385491,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロブライト",
            "enName": "Mejiro Bright",
            "jpText": "うう～ん、ふふふ……ええと。",
            "enText": "Ummm… Hehehe… Hmm…",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": -5139772230947892974,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロブライト",
            "enName": "Mejiro Bright",
            "jpText": "実は、途中でウトウトしてしまって……\r\nあまり覚えていないんです～。",
            "enText": "Actually… I think I dozed off during our drive.\nI can't recall much about it.",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": 3008648337094050932,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "スペシャルウィーク",
            "enName": "Special Week",
            "jpText": "え……えええええ……！？",
            "enText": "Wha… Hooow?!",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "pathId": -168690253563249276,
            "blockIdx": 11
        }
    ],
    "modified": 1780176857,
    "humanTl": true
}